    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">NLV vs Student Visa Spain: Which Should You Choose?</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">Spain's Non-Lucrative Visa and the student visa are both valid routes for non-EU nationals wanting to live in Spain long-term. They look similar on the surface — both are non-working visas — but they serve very different purposes and suit different people. Here's a direct comparison.</p>
  </div>
